# The rendered email artifacts are compared byte-for-byte in two places: the
# vitest drift guard (`web/src/emails/templates.sync.test.tsx`) checks the
# committed files against a fresh `@react-email/render` pass, and the API suite
# checks Python's placeholder substitution against the committed preview. Both
# renderers emit LF. This repo is developed on Windows with `core.autocrlf=true`,
# which would rewrite them to CRLF on checkout and fail both comparisons on a
# clean clone while passing for whoever generated them.
api/src/wtg_api/templates/emails/** text eol=lf
api/tests/fixtures/emails/** text eol=lf
